---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---
<Layout
  title="Why southern Morocco is my playground · CDM Motorsport"
  description="Variety of terrain, rally-raid heritage, perfect climate, warm hospitality: why southern Morocco is my playground for motorcycle rally-raid tours."
  ogImage="/img/village.jpg"
  lang={lang}
>
  <section class="phero short" style="background-image:url('/img/village.jpg')">
    <div class="wrap c">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="color:#e8c9a6">Destination</div>
      <h1>Southern <em>Morocco</em></h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pad">
    <div class="wrap article">
      <div class="meta reveal">Destination · 6 min read</div>
      <div class="big reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        Why southern Morocco<br />is my <em>playground</em>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <p>
          If I chose southern Morocco to take people riding, it isn't by chance. In just a
          few days, you cover every face of rally-raid: fast flowing pistes you can roll
          through, rocky plateaus that make you read every meter, dry riverbeds, dune
          ridges, the passes of the Anti-Atlas. Nowhere else do you find such variety
          packed so tight. <a href="/en/#raids">My raids</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Then there's the history. These landscapes have seen the great African adventures
          roll through, and you can still feel that spirit when you ride here. It's hard
          not to think about it as you crest a trail.
        </p>
        <p>
          The climate helps a lot: between the Atlantic coast and the mountains, Morocco
          offers long windows where you can ride in good conditions for most of the year.
          <a href="https://www.visitmorocco.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tourism in Morocco</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          But in the end, what stays with you isn't just the riding. It's the villages
          clinging to the mountainside, a shared tea when you arrive, the welcome from the
          people. Here, every stage is a chance encounter. <a href="/en/#maroc">Discover Morocco</a>.
        </p>

        <p style="margin-top:28px">
          Want to discover this terrain?
        </p>
        <a href="/en/reserver" class="btn dark" style="margin-top:14px">Book a raid</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
